            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:51:04.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 13820,
            "question_id": 16836,
            "provider": "compose_prompt",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Use the past perfect continuous for the earlier process. Start with the main-clause subject; do not move time or reason phrases to the front. Describe coastal driving ending when access to the road was blocked.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:51:04.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:51:04.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 13821,
            "question_id": 16836,
            "provider": "polyglot-v3",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Lexical verb: drive. Describe the process leading up to a past point, not merely a finished result. Preserve the stated cause, contrast or time relation.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:51:04.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:51:04.000000Z"
        },
        {
